text = "Solarian Coalition Personnel Record - CALIHAN LONAN
[confidential personnel file]

FULL NAME:  Calihan Lonan
STATUS:  Registered Citizen
SERVICE ID:  2374-092-CL
OCCUPATION:  Interstellar Courier for The Farseeing Courier Company
WORLD OF BIRTH:  Brimpie-3
REGISTERED HOMEWORLD:  Brimpie-3
REGISTERED RESIDENCE:  Apartment 907, Habitat Zone 7

ASSOCIATIONS:
  Registered domestic partnership with Naomi Lonan-Roseberry
  Registered Parents: Elias Lonan and Jeneva Lonan(deceased)

OCCUPATION:
  Currently serving as a Farseeing Interstellar Courier.
  Former Wheat and Algae Farmer before gaining admission into the 
  Solarian Academy of Pilots.

NOTES:
  Psychological profile indicates emotional detachment, high stress tolerance, 
  and low interpersonal engagement.
  
  Underwent disciplinary review following altercation with superior officer.
  See incident report: SY-379 for more info.

Remarks:
  \"Lonan works best alone. Doesn't ask for help, doesn't expect it either.\"
   - Supervisor D. Renhall, Farseeing Courier Management Division 4

   \"Shows signs of unresolved trauma. Possible bullying from peers.\"
   - Dr. Elia Morrix, Psych Eval"
label_settings = ExtResource("5_d3stu")
clip_text = true

