text = "Solarian Coalition Personnel Record - NAOMI LONAN-ROSEBERRY
[confidential personnel file]

FULL NAME:  Naomi Lonan-Roseberry
STATUS:  Registered Citizen
SERVICE ID:  4449-773-NR
OCCUPATION:  N/A
WORLD OF BIRTH:  Brimpie-4, Buoy Station 16
REGISTERED HOMEWORLD:  Brimpie-3
REGISTERED RESIDENCE:  Apartment 907, Habitat Zone 7

ASSOCIATIONS:
  Registered domestic partnership with Calihan Lonan.
  No immediate family on file.

OCCUPATION:
  Former Deep Space Radio Operator and Telemetry Officer.
  Occupation lost due to advancements in automated systems.

NOTES:
  Previous psychological evaluations note elevated empathy levels, signs of codependency, 
  and chronic anxiety.
  
  Applied multiple times for off-world transfer; all applications denied due to 
  bureaucratic backlog.

  Rumors of involvement in unauthorized signal tracing and Coalition surveillance evasion.

Remarks:
  “Brilliant mind. Too soft for Coalition work.”
   - Director R. Zannis, Brimpie-4 Communications Admin"
